GIVEN a IS A TYPE
      xs IS A LIST OF a
      x IS AN a
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`dmnmd list contains` xs x MEANS
  CONSIDER xs
  WHEN EMPTY THEN FALSE
  WHEN y FOLLOWED BY ys THEN x EQUALS y OR `dmnmd list contains` ys x

GIVEN tags IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE STRING
Scores tags MEANS
  BRANCH
    IF `dmnmd list contains` tags 5   THEN JUST "pass"
    IF `dmnmd list contains` tags 7   THEN JUST "fail"
    OTHERWISE NOTHING

